                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Its a fun game, and a good port. It WOULD be a perfect game if it weren't for two things:\n1. Its incredibly easy. The animatronics are all braindead compared to their flatscreen counterparts.\n2. For some unknown and/or dumb reason, the FNAF 4 levels are there, but the nightmare animatronics were replaced by the funtime animatronics, which if you're anything like me, is a huge disappointment. \nThe game is easy to run, immersive enough for vr, but quite short due to just how easy the game is.",
